    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to one of your allies being attacked, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check, replacing the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense Scores\">Defense Scores</a> of that ally with the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check for the resolution of that attack. If any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense Scores\">Defense Scores</a> are higher than the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check result, your ally can use that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense_Score\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense Score\">Defense Score</a> instead. If the attack still hits, this does not count as the one use per encounter aspect of this Talent.",
